WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.713
Welcome to NiviLog, your private food and
feelings journal.

2
00:00:03.873 --> 00:00:05.708
Here's how to make it part of your day.

3
00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:08.867
Start in Logs.

4
00:00:09.027 --> 00:00:13.869
Your meals and check-ins stay together, and the
filters help you find earlier entries.

5
00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:17.348
To log a meal, tap Add an entry.

6
00:00:17.508 --> 00:00:21.988
Describe what you ate, including amounts when
you can, then tap Review and save.

7
00:00:22.867 --> 00:00:24.765
Check the foods NiviLog found.

8
00:00:24.925 --> 00:00:29.405
These are suggested matches, so correct anything
that doesn't reflect your meal.

9
00:00:30.367 --> 00:00:33.503
Tap Edit to adjust a portion or choose another
food.

10
00:00:33.663 --> 00:00:36.265
When the foods and amounts look right, save your
meal.

11
00:00:37.867 --> 00:00:40.640
Daily View brings your logged nutrition
together.

12
00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:45.301
These are estimates, and they only include the
meals and portions you've recorded.

13
00:00:46.167 --> 00:00:49.751
In Settings, open Nutrition goals to choose
daily markers.

14
00:00:49.911 --> 00:00:54.967
Set targets that suit your plan; the app's
starting values aren't personal recommendations.

15
00:00:55.833 --> 00:00:58.009
For a check-in, choose How I'm feeling.

16
00:00:58.169 --> 00:01:01.391
Record a feeling, mood, or energy rating, then
save.

17
00:01:01.551 --> 00:01:03.300
Add notes whenever they're useful.

18
00:01:04.167 --> 00:01:07.644
In Patterns, look back over seven, thirty, or
ninety days.

19
00:01:07.804 --> 00:01:12.199
Days without entries stay blank, so gaps aren't
mistaken for low ratings.

20
00:01:13.067 --> 00:01:17.056
Switch to Nutrition to follow protein, carbs,
fat, and fiber.

21
00:01:17.216 --> 00:01:19.904
Tap the chart to explore a day's logged values.

22
00:01:20.767 --> 00:01:26.185
Food and feelings can highlight possible
associations when enough records are available.

23
00:01:26.345 --> 00:01:30.185
These observations don't prove a cause or
diagnose an allergy.

24
00:01:31.067 --> 00:01:33.072
Choose English or Spanish in Settings.

25
00:01:33.232 --> 00:01:39.355
Adjust text size, contrast, and other
accessibility options to make your journal
comfortable to use.

26
00:01:40.233 --> 00:01:42.921
NiviLog works offline and is free to use.

27
00:01:43.081 --> 00:01:45.023
Start with a meal and one check-in.

28
00:01:45.183 --> 00:01:46.847
A product by Hoplontec.
